Assembled by Palestinian artist Said Baalbaki, the exhibition presents 50 of Abbo's sketches, et[ch]ings and object, as well as texts – all taken from[ Baal]baki's personal collection of work[ from], and publications on, the elusive sculptor.[ Baal]baki has no[ work] of his own[ in this show].
[Born in] Saf[ad,] northern Palestine[, around] 1888-[18]90[, Ab]bo was a[ farmer] and[ fisherman] who later took up carpentry and stone masonry. It was not[ until] he moved to Berlin[ in] 1911 to study sculpture[ that] his artistic career took shape.
